{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to build your dream e-commerce empire?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E-commerce Simulation</strong> is a detailed and realistic life-simulation game that puts you in the shoes of an aspiring entrepreneur. Starting from a tiny, single-room apartment, you'll experience every aspect of running an online business \u2014 from sourcing products and packaging to handling orders and earning customer satisfaction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic City Life:</strong> A living, breathing city filled with traffic, NPCs, and interactive locations, all designed to simulate a realistic urban environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/7bc674633091f9261bd3adf1daf0ae8f.poster.avif?t=1754567164\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/7bc674633091f9261bd3adf1daf0ae8f.webm?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/7bc674633091f9261bd3adf1daf0ae8f.mp4?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive E-Commerce Mechanics:</strong> Accept orders, package products, ship them to customers, and manage your brand based on customer feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/0476124269bef1abff7211f31dcc0ba6.poster.avif?t=1754567164\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/0476124269bef1abff7211f31dcc0ba6.webm?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/0476124269bef1abff7211f31dcc0ba6.mp4?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Survival Systems:</strong> Manage your hunger, sleep, bills, and time within a 24-hour day-night cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/7b2a8aaf0a6109da109a97a40be1fce7.poster.avif?t=1754567164\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/7b2a8aaf0a6109da109a97a40be1fce7.webm?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/7b2a8aaf0a6109da109a97a40be1fce7.mp4?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expandable Business:</strong> Upgrade to larger homes, unlock storage warehouses, and eventually run your own factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/a95648052aab9d9a9b97e4c79be65292.poster.avif?t=1754567164\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/a95648052aab9d9a9b97e4c79be65292.webm?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/a95648052aab9d9a9b97e4c79be65292.mp4?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle Ownership and Driving:</strong> Buy vehicles from a dealership and freely drive around the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/e538e483333f3c475cf535142aa0a137.poster.avif?t=1754567164\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/e538e483333f3c475cf535142aa0a137.webm?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/e538e483333f3c475cf535142aa0a137.mp4?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced UI &amp; PC Simulation:</strong> Use your in-game computer to manage orders, apps, finances, and business growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/d60e485ae8da5a835bd6a75fd0b7a1fa.poster.avif?t=1754567164\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/d60e485ae8da5a835bd6a75fd0b7a1fa.webm?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/d60e485ae8da5a835bd6a75fd0b7a1fa.mp4?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Role-Playing Elements:</strong> Explore the city, shop for groceries, visit entertainment venues, and build your lifestyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/c8115a30c98c01474f6cee0e0489b5af.poster.avif?t=1754567164\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/c8115a30c98c01474f6cee0e0489b5af.webm?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/extras/c8115a30c98c01474f6cee0e0489b5af.mp4?t=1754567164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Awaits You?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >$100 starting capital, an old desktop computer, and a cramped little room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 unique products and hundreds of potential customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep logistics system: shipping, customer feedback, fines, jail sequences, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable content: storage units, production factories, expensive cars, and luxury homes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life isn\u2019t only about selling... but in this city, you\u2019ll need to sell to survive. Build your brand, fulfill your orders, and dive into the world of E-commerce Simulation!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3833050?t=1754567164","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/4f39c3e5a25d2fc45e59ccab31baf70f1281ec0e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754567164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/d0b35ccc76856f6f091692f2e5c9a1a3c58ee8fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754567164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833050/d0b35ccc76856f6f091692f2e5c9a1a3c58ee8fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754567164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Fami